      "content": "it's not just a setback though. i've spent my whole adult life on this. my entire identity is tied to being a researcher. if i'm not that, then i'm just some failure who wasted a decade of their life for nothing. the thought of having to start over or even try to explain this to anyone... it feels impossible. like there's just no way back from this.",
